5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check the morning routine upstairs and the unplanned shuffles. I hate losing my little gaps between meetings!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to understand the financial reality before we move anything. I will look into the floor billing basis and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
