9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m picking the arrival times and the two project strands. I really want to know how our seating changes who we actually talk to!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the quote is huge, maybe we just keep the desks? I don't want to waste my gaps on moving boxes!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
